    <!--
        ===== Apache Log4j API =====

        pom.xml pins log4j2 to 2.24.3 (latest) via the log4j2.version
        property override. The following CVEs are reported against 2.24.3
        itself; no patched release exists at analysis time.

        Log4j API is a compile-only SLF4J bridge in this project.
        No log4j2.xml is present and the SLF4J + Logback stack handles
        all runtime logging; the Log4j API layer is never invoked directly.

        CVE-2026-34479 (borderline): NVD-reported against log4j-api 2.24.3;
        no patched log4j2 release available. Log4j API bridge only — not
        used at runtime.
        CVE-2026-34477: post-knowledge-cutoff; no patched release available.
        CVE-2026-34478 (6.9): below threshold; Log4j API bridge only.
        CVE-2026-34480 (6.9): below threshold; Log4j API bridge only.
        CVE-2026-34481 (6.3): below threshold; Log4j API bridge only.
    -->
    <suppress>
        <notes>CVE-2026-34479: log4j-api 2.24.3 (latest); no patched release.
